<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8' standalone='no'?>
<doxygen xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:noNamespaceSchemaLocation="compound.xsd" version="1.18.0" xml:lang="en-US">
  <compounddef id="set_value_plugin" kind="page">
    <compoundname>set_value_plugin</compoundname>
    <title>Set_value plugin</title>
    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><anchor id="set_value_plugin_1md_plugins_2set__value_2README"/></para>
<para>The Set_value plugin allows setting values to data and metadata descriptors from the yaml file.</para>
<para>Here are main features of the plugins:</para>
<para><orderedlist>
<listitem><para>Share data - plugin will share new allocated data with given values</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Release data - plugin will release shared data</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Expose data - plugin will expose new allocated data with given values</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Set data - plugin will set given values to the already shared data</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Calling an event - plugin will call an event</para>
</listitem></orderedlist>
</para>
<sect1 id="set_value_plugin_1set_value_plugins_set_value">
<title><computeroutput>plugins.set_value</computeroutput></title><para>A mapping, the operations to execute and when.</para>
<para>The operations of <ref refid="set_value_plugin_1set_value_plugins_set_value_on_event" kindref="member"><computeroutput>plugins.set_value.on_event</computeroutput></ref>, <ref refid="set_value_plugin_1set_value_plugins_set_value_on_data" kindref="member"><computeroutput>plugins.set_value.on_data</computeroutput></ref>, <ref refid="set_value_plugin_1set_value_plugins_set_value_on_init" kindref="member"><computeroutput>plugins.set_value.on_init</computeroutput></ref> and <ref refid="set_value_plugin_1set_value_plugins_set_value_on_finalize" kindref="member"><computeroutput>plugins.set_value.on_finalize</computeroutput></ref> are given in the same form, documented in <ref refid="set_value_plugin_1set_value_operations" kindref="member"><computeroutput>&lt;operations&gt;</computeroutput></ref>.</para>
</sect1>
<sect1 id="set_value_plugin_1set_value_plugins_set_value_on_init">
<title><computeroutput>plugins.set_value.on_init</computeroutput></title><para><emphasis>Optional.</emphasis> An <ref refid="set_value_plugin_1set_value_operations" kindref="member">operation list</ref>, the operations to execute in <ref refid="group__init__final_1ga3dc660be40c93c169337e3d2692b2ed0" kindref="member">PDI_init</ref>, once all data are defined.</para>
<sect2 id="set_value_plugin_1example-of-pluginsset_valueon_init">
<title>Example of <computeroutput>plugins.set_value.on_init</computeroutput></title><para><programlisting filename=".yaml"><codeline><highlight class="normal">plugins:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>set_value:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>on_init:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>set:<sp/>...<sp/>#<sp/>value_list</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>share:<sp/>...<sp/>#<sp/>value_list</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>expose:<sp/>...<sp/>#<sp/>value_list</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>release:<sp/>...<sp/>#<sp/>value_list</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>event:<sp/>...<sp/>#<sp/>value</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>logger:<sp/>...<sp/>#<sp/>logger_map</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting></para>
</sect2>
</sect1>
<sect1 id="set_value_plugin_1set_value_plugins_set_value_on_event">
<title><computeroutput>plugins.set_value.on_event</computeroutput></title><para><emphasis>Optional.</emphasis> A mapping, the operations to execute when events are emitted.</para>
</sect1>
<sect1 id="set_value_plugin_1set_value_plugins_set_value_on_event_event_name">
<title><computeroutput>plugins.set_value.on_event.&lt;event_name&gt;</computeroutput></title><para>An <ref refid="set_value_plugin_1set_value_operations" kindref="member">operation list</ref>, the operations to execute each time the event named <computeroutput>&lt;event_name&gt;</computeroutput> is emitted.</para>
<sect2 id="set_value_plugin_1example-of-pluginsset_valueon_eventevent_name">
<title>Example of <computeroutput>plugins.set_value.on_event.&lt;event_name&gt;</computeroutput></title><para><programlisting filename=".yaml"><codeline><highlight class="normal">plugins:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>set_value:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>on_event:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>event_1_name:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>set:<sp/>...<sp/>#<sp/>value_list</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>share:<sp/>...<sp/>#<sp/>value_list</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>event_2_name:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>expose:<sp/>...<sp/>#<sp/>value_list</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>release:<sp/>...<sp/>#<sp/>value_list</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>event:<sp/>...<sp/>#<sp/>value</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting></para>
</sect2>
</sect1>
<sect1 id="set_value_plugin_1set_value_plugins_set_value_on_data">
<title><computeroutput>plugins.set_value.on_data</computeroutput></title><para><emphasis>Optional.</emphasis> A mapping, the operations to execute when data are shared.</para>
</sect1>
<sect1 id="set_value_plugin_1set_value_plugins_set_value_on_data_data_name">
<title><computeroutput>plugins.set_value.on_data.&lt;data_name&gt;</computeroutput></title><para>An <ref refid="set_value_plugin_1set_value_operations" kindref="member">operation list</ref>, the operations to execute each time the data or metadata named <computeroutput>&lt;data_name&gt;</computeroutput> is shared.</para>
<sect2 id="set_value_plugin_1example-of-pluginsset_valueon_datadata_name">
<title>Example of <computeroutput>plugins.set_value.on_data.&lt;data_name&gt;</computeroutput></title><para><programlisting filename=".yaml"><codeline><highlight class="normal">metadata:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>metadata_1_name:<sp/>...<sp/>#<sp/>metadata_type</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">data:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>data_1_name:<sp/>...<sp/><sp/>#<sp/>data_type</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">plugins:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>set_value:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>on_data:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>data_1_name:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>set:<sp/>...<sp/>#<sp/>value_list</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>event:<sp/>...<sp/>#<sp/>value</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>metadata_1_name:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>share:<sp/>...<sp/>#<sp/>value_list</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>release:<sp/>...<sp/>#<sp/>value_list</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting></para>
</sect2>
</sect1>
<sect1 id="set_value_plugin_1set_value_plugins_set_value_on_finalize">
<title><computeroutput>plugins.set_value.on_finalize</computeroutput></title><para><emphasis>Optional.</emphasis> An <ref refid="set_value_plugin_1set_value_operations" kindref="member">operation list</ref>, the operations to execute in <ref refid="group__init__final_1ga7995fbda2099950ed4ffc7fd4c0bb969" kindref="member">PDI_finalize</ref>.</para>
</sect1>
<sect1 id="set_value_plugin_1set_value_plugins_set_value_logging">
<title><computeroutput>plugins.set_value.logging</computeroutput></title><para><emphasis>Optional.</emphasis> The configuration of the logger of the plugin, see <ref refid="Specification_tree_ref_1spectree_plugins_plugin_name_logging" kindref="member"><computeroutput>plugins.&lt;plugin_name&gt;.logging</computeroutput></ref>.</para>
</sect1>
<sect1 id="set_value_plugin_1set_value_operations">
<title><computeroutput>&lt;operations&gt;</computeroutput></title><para>An <emphasis>operation list</emphasis> is the value of <ref refid="set_value_plugin_1set_value_plugins_set_value_on_init" kindref="member"><computeroutput>plugins.set_value.on_init</computeroutput></ref>, <ref refid="set_value_plugin_1set_value_plugins_set_value_on_event_event_name" kindref="member"><computeroutput>plugins.set_value.on_event.&lt;event_name&gt;</computeroutput></ref>, <ref refid="set_value_plugin_1set_value_plugins_set_value_on_data_data_name" kindref="member"><computeroutput>plugins.set_value.on_data.&lt;data_name&gt;</computeroutput></ref> and <ref refid="set_value_plugin_1set_value_plugins_set_value_on_finalize" kindref="member"><computeroutput>plugins.set_value.on_finalize</computeroutput></ref>. It is a <bold>sequence</bold>, even if it holds a single operation, whose elements are executed in order. Each element is a mapping with a single key, the kind of operation, documented below.</para>
</sect1>
<sect1 id="set_value_plugin_1set_value_operations_set">
<title><computeroutput>&lt;operations&gt;[*].set</computeroutput></title><para>A <ref refid="set_value_plugin_1set_value_value_list" kindref="member"><computeroutput>&lt;operations&gt;[*].&lt;set|share|expose&gt;</computeroutput></ref>, the values to set to data that are already shared, with write access.</para>
</sect1>
<sect1 id="set_value_plugin_1set_value_operations_share">
<title><computeroutput>&lt;operations&gt;[*].share</computeroutput></title><para>A <ref refid="set_value_plugin_1set_value_value_list" kindref="member"><computeroutput>&lt;operations&gt;[*].&lt;set|share|expose&gt;</computeroutput></ref>, the values to share, with read and write rights.</para>
<para>The plugin allocates the memory itself, and frees it when the data is released. If you reclaim the data instead, PDI no longer manages that memory.</para>
</sect1>
<sect1 id="set_value_plugin_1set_value_operations_expose">
<title><computeroutput>&lt;operations&gt;[*].expose</computeroutput></title><para>A <ref refid="set_value_plugin_1set_value_value_list" kindref="member"><computeroutput>&lt;operations&gt;[*].&lt;set|share|expose&gt;</computeroutput></ref>, the values to expose: each data is shared, then released immediately.</para>
</sect1>
<sect1 id="set_value_plugin_1set_value_operations_release">
<title><computeroutput>&lt;operations&gt;[*].release</computeroutput></title><para>A sequence of scalars, the names of the data to release.</para>
</sect1>
<sect1 id="set_value_plugin_1set_value_operations_event">
<title><computeroutput>&lt;operations&gt;[*].event</computeroutput></title><para>A scalar, the name of an event to emit.</para>
</sect1>
<sect1 id="set_value_plugin_1set_value_operations_logger">
<title><computeroutput>&lt;operations&gt;[*].logger</computeroutput></title><para>A mapping, settings to apply to the global PDI logger.</para>
</sect1>
<sect1 id="set_value_plugin_1set_value_operations_logger_level">
<title><computeroutput>&lt;operations&gt;[*].logger.level</computeroutput></title><para><emphasis>Optional.</emphasis> A <ref refid="Specification_tree_ref_1spectree_expression" kindref="member">$-expressions</ref>, the level to set to the logger of PDI, evaluated each time the operation is executed.</para>
</sect1>
<sect1 id="set_value_plugin_1set_value_operations_logger_pattern">
<title><computeroutput>&lt;operations&gt;[*].logger.pattern</computeroutput></title><para><emphasis>Optional.</emphasis> A scalar, the pattern to set to the logger of PDI and to those of the plugins that do not set their own.</para>
</sect1>
<sect1 id="set_value_plugin_1set_value_operations_logger_evaluate">
<title><computeroutput>&lt;operations&gt;[*].logger.evaluate</computeroutput></title><para><emphasis>Optional.</emphasis> A <ref refid="Specification_tree_ref_1spectree_expression" kindref="member">$-expressions</ref> evaluated at initialization, whether to evaluate the logger pattern again each time the operation is executed.</para>
</sect1>
<sect1 id="set_value_plugin_1set_value_value_list">
<title><computeroutput>&lt;operations&gt;[*].&lt;set|share|expose&gt;</computeroutput></title><para>A <emphasis>value list</emphasis> is the value of <ref refid="set_value_plugin_1set_value_operations_set" kindref="member"><computeroutput>&lt;operations&gt;[*].set</computeroutput></ref>, <ref refid="set_value_plugin_1set_value_operations_share" kindref="member"><computeroutput>&lt;operations&gt;[*].share</computeroutput></ref> and <ref refid="set_value_plugin_1set_value_operations_expose" kindref="member"><computeroutput>&lt;operations&gt;[*].expose</computeroutput></ref>. It is a sequence of mappings with a single key each, whose elements are handled in order.</para>
</sect1>
<sect1 id="set_value_plugin_1set_value_value_list_data_name">
<title><computeroutput>&lt;operations&gt;[*].&lt;set|share|expose&gt;[*].&lt;data_name&gt;</computeroutput></title><para>A <ref refid="Specification_tree_ref_1spectree_expression" kindref="member">$-expressions</ref>, or a sequence or mapping of them, converted to the type of the data named <computeroutput>&lt;data_name&gt;</computeroutput>. It can be:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>a scalar, to set a scalar data,</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>a sequence of values, to set an array,</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>a mapping associating each member name to its value, to set a record.</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<sect2 id="set_value_plugin_1set_value_example_scalar">
<title>Example of a scalar value</title><para><programlisting filename=".yaml"><codeline><highlight class="normal">metadata:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>scalar_name:<sp/>int</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">plugins:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>set_value:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>on_init:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>expose:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>scalar_name:<sp/>42</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting></para>
</sect2>
<sect2 id="set_value_plugin_1set_value_example_array">
<title>Example of an array value</title><para><programlisting filename=".yaml"><codeline><highlight class="normal">metadata:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>array_name:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>type:<sp/>array</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>size:<sp/>4</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>subtype:<sp/>int</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">plugins:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>set_value:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>on_init:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>expose:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>array_name:<sp/>[2,<sp/>3,<sp/>4,<sp/>5]</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting></para>
</sect2>
<sect2 id="set_value_plugin_1set_value_example_record">
<title>Example of a record value</title><para><programlisting filename=".yaml"><codeline><highlight class="normal">metadata:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>record_name:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>type:<sp/>record</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>buffersize:<sp/>16</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>members:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>member_1:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>disp:<sp/>0</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>type:<sp/>array</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>size:<sp/>3</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>subtype:<sp/>int</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>member_2:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>disp:<sp/>12</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>type:<sp/>int</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">plugins:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>set_value:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>on_init:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>expose:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>record_name:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>member_2:<sp/>3<sp/>#<sp/>int<sp/>member</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>member_1:<sp/>[1,<sp/>2,<sp/>3]<sp/>#<sp/>array<sp/>of<sp/>ints<sp/>member</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting></para>
</sect2>
</sect1>
<sect1 id="set_value_plugin_1full_config">
<title>full configuration example</title><para><programlisting filename=".yaml"><codeline><highlight class="normal">metadata:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>array_size:<sp/>int64</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">data:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>record_data:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>type:<sp/>record</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>buffersize:<sp/>36</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>members:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>scalar_data:<sp/></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>disp:<sp/>0</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>type:<sp/>int</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>array_data:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>disp:<sp/>4</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>type:<sp/>array</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>size:<sp/>$array_size</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>subtype:<sp/>int</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">plugins:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>set_value:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>on_init:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>expose:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>array_size:<sp/>3</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>share:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>record_data:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>scalar_data:<sp/>0</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>array_data:<sp/>[0,<sp/>0,<sp/>0]</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>on_event:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>event_1_name:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>set:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>record_data:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>scalar_data:<sp/>3</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>array_data:<sp/>[1,<sp/>2,<sp/>3]</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>on_finalize:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>release:<sp/>[record_data]</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting></para>
</sect1>
<sect1 id="set_value_plugin_1old_to_new">
<title>Using old values to set new</title><sect2 id="set_value_plugin_1increment">
<title>Increment value</title><para>The set_value plugin allows to use the old values to set new values, you can use even the same descriptor, for example to increment a scalar.</para>
<para><programlisting filename=".yaml"><codeline><highlight class="normal">data:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>value_int:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>type:<sp/>int</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>int_array:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>size:<sp/>3</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>subtype:<sp/>int</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>type:<sp/>array</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">plugins:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>set_value:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>on_event:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>init:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>share:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>value_int:<sp/>0</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>int_array:<sp/>[1,<sp/>2,<sp/>3]</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>increment:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>set:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>value_int:<sp/>&quot;$value_int<sp/>+<sp/>1&quot;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>int_array:<sp/>[&quot;$int_array[0]<sp/>+<sp/>1&quot;,<sp/>&quot;$int_array[1]<sp/>+<sp/>1&quot;,<sp/>&quot;$int_array[2]<sp/>+<sp/>1&quot;]</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>on_finalize:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>release:<sp/>[value_int,<sp/>int_array]</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting> After calling <computeroutput>init</computeroutput> and <computeroutput>increment</computeroutput> event, <computeroutput>value_int</computeroutput> will be equal 1, and <computeroutput>int_array</computeroutput> to [2, 3, 4].</para>
</sect2>
<sect2 id="set_value_plugin_1increment_in_array">
<title>Getting old value</title><para>The new value is set at the end of processing the whole descriptors. This means, that if you want to update the array element depending on other element, the old value will be set:</para>
<para><programlisting filename=".yaml"><codeline><highlight class="normal">metadata:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>int_array:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>size:<sp/>3</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>subtype:<sp/>int</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>type:<sp/>array</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">plugins:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>set_value:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>on_event:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>init:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>expose:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>int_array:<sp/>[0,<sp/>0,<sp/>0]</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>increment:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>expose:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>int_array:<sp/>[&quot;$int_array[0]<sp/>+<sp/>1&quot;,<sp/>&quot;$int_array[0]<sp/>+<sp/>1&quot;,<sp/>&quot;$int_array[1]<sp/>+<sp/>1&quot;]</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting> After calling <computeroutput>init</computeroutput> and <computeroutput>increment</computeroutput> event, all values in <computeroutput>int_array</computeroutput> will equal <computeroutput>1</computeroutput>. This is because the <computeroutput>int_array[0]</computeroutput> was updated after setting all the elements.</para>
</sect2>
<sect2 id="set_value_plugin_1update_array_after_scalar">
<title>Getting new value</title><para><programlisting filename=".yaml"><codeline><highlight class="normal">metadata:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>int_scalar:<sp/>int</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>int_array:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>size:<sp/>3</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>subtype:<sp/>int</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>type:<sp/>array</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">plugins:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>set_value:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>on_event:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>init:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>expose:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>int_scalar:<sp/>0</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>int_array:<sp/>[0,<sp/>0,<sp/>0]</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>increment:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>expose:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>int_scalar:<sp/>$int_scalar+1</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>int_array:<sp/>[&quot;$int_scalar&quot;,<sp/>&quot;$int_scalar&quot;,<sp/>&quot;$int_scalar&quot;]</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting> After calling <computeroutput>init</computeroutput> and <computeroutput>increment</computeroutput> event, all values in <computeroutput>int_array</computeroutput> will equal <computeroutput>1</computeroutput>. This is because the <computeroutput>int_scalar</computeroutput> is set and then the <computeroutput>int_array</computeroutput> is updated after the <computeroutput>int_scalar</computeroutput> has a new value. </para>
</sect2>
</sect1>
